The Operating Advantage
Review gating tries to improve the rating by controlling which customers reach the public-review page. A stronger program improves the request itself.

Make the request timely. Give it real context. Make it easy to act. Leave the opinion to the customer. Measure the whole funnel and use criticism as operating intelligence.

That approach can produce more reviews, richer review text, stronger customer recovery, and a review profile that prospective customers can trust.

